        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$nervous_intro",
        "key": "$nervous_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "Wh-why are those outsiders sticking their noses in our business?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rebellious Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you, Severin! Your son died in that fire! How can you still aid those incompetent swine?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rebellious Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Put down the blade and tell me who pushed you to do this? Who gave you those weapons?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Final warning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gah\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rebellious Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fightgeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's assault with a deadly weapon. You think you can just go back to your homes? You'll get a knock on your door soon enough. The Gendarmerie will hold you accountable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just 'hold them accountable?'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't have to explain our accountability processes to a couple of tourists.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you have anything at all to tell 'a couple of tourists' then? 'Schultz?'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I do. You're strong. Stronger than I'd expect a doctor to be. Impressive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "And... thank you for the assistance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Usually, we go by 'Operator.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now can you tell us where Atro is?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not safe here. Let's talk somewhere else.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness01_intro",
        "key": "$darkness01_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Good work, Miss Folinic.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry I'm not much help in battle...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's fine. You did your best. If I'd known what was happening in Wolumonde, I wouldn't have brought you along.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if we're just helping resolve some disputes, you're too young to be dragged into\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#2",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss Folinic!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#2",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014*Sigh* ...Fine, fine. Little Lisa's all grown up now. Did you get hurt?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I'm fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you were spacing out back there. What's wrong?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The quarantine zone is right near here. Everything seems to have gone back to peace and quiet after we drove off the protestors.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm... It doesn't seem that different from any other place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're right, it's not that different. They have shops, caf\u00e9s, ads for music halls and art salons...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "No one's getting rounded up by guards and sent out to the tundra to die. They get to live pretty ordinary lives... You might even say they live well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Infected get treated so differently all around the world.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If every place was so good to the Infected...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We'd be out of a job.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wha?! I mean, that's true, but I'd be really happy about it! E-even though I just became an operator...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm kidding... The fact that Infected can roam the streets freely only serves to underscore how special the situation in Wolumonde is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "...They're hiding something from us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Where did that come from\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Shh! Lower your voice! We'll talk once the officer is gone!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Infected rebels are acting really weird. And they keep talking about a 'fire' and a 'doctor,' right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "Add in that officer who definitely knows who we are, and who really doesn't want to tell me anything about Atro...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I can't shake the feeling that something rotten is brewing in this town.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even Leithanien wouldn't go so far as to let the Infected riot in the streets. Where are the guards? Why isn't anyone stopping them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Now that you mention it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I've got a bad feeling about this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "M-maybe everyone's just a little on edge? Considering what the town's been through...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...I pray that's all it is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm so sorry to have dragged you into all this just as you've arrived. It's shameful...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, don't worry about it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you part of the local Gendarmerie?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Not really. But everyone in Wolumonde undergoes military training. When the time comes, we have a duty to take up arms...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "text": "But Uncle... Err, Schultz Severin is our town's highest official.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The middle-aged smoker who really doesn't want to do his job? Too bad, but that irresponsible disregard for duty doesn't exactly come off as mysterious.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "There's a reason he is the way he is\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "text": "No... never mind...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh right, how should I call you two?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Call me Operator Folinic, and this is Operator Suzuran.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Folinic, Suzuran... these are code names?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Where we come from, most people prefer not to use their real names at work. Just like 'Atro.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. Atro...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Seems you're acquainted.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes... Sorry. I know you have your doubts, but the Schultz will give you the answers you need. It's not my place to say.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, come with me please.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_ltroom",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068"
    },
    {
        "text": "How much did you tell them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not much. Not enough to upset anyone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I've put forward some unreasonable ideas, but you're always free to reject them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's a creative way to dodge responsibility. But you'll get no comfort from me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I stood here and told them the whole, unadulterated truth right now, would you be happy? Would that make everyone happy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I represent the people, but you're the leader of Wolumonde. What does it matter if we're happy or not?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't want to make things difficult. Especially when I'm hosting guests at the same time the Infected are stirring.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh*... Put it away. You want to make a good impression on Rhodes Island. Now's not the time to be lighting cigarettes or playing with crossbow bolts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I think we're well past any good impressions...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You\u2014\u2014Wait, are they the two young girls out there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Young girls? Hah, wait until you see them fight. Then you'll start wondering if Leithanian schools focus too much on the arts, just like those bureaucrats.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sirs, they're here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, it's the doctors from Rhodes Island! Welcome to Wolumonde! I am so sorry you had to get roped into our local affairs like that. Let us make it up to you with an evening\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you for the offer, but we're only here to establish Dr. Atro's whereabouts. We don't intend to stay long.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, where is she?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068"
    },
    {
        "text": "Erm, well\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "The local Infected seem to know 'Dr. Atro.' You're stalling, and I'd prefer you not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctors, I'm very sorry, but things in Wolumonde are very complicated right now. We need some time to give your company a proper explanation, in order to guarantee\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "She disappeared.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wha?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Sir, when it comes to matters such as this, you might want to shed that flippant attitude of yours.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The truth is flippant. It's simple. No need to sugar coat it. You're angry now, but you're not surprised. You already guessed it, didn't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "We received the Infected doctor who called herself 'Atro.' And we greatly appreciate her help caring for the many Infected residents of Wolumonde during this difficult time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And you show your appreciation by telling us 'she disappeared?'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No need for hostility here... *Cough*, *hack hack*\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066#3",
        "name2": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir, you look unwell. You should quit smoking.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "text": "It would probably be a good idea to get a physical examination, as it could be\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...No thanks, but I appreciate the concern.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$nervous_intro",
        "key": "$nervous_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066"
    },
    {
        "text": "Back to business, after Wolumonde steered over here to avoid Catastrophe, Dr. Atro set up camp on the edge of town. She was housing some Infected residents.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "But not long ago, there was a fire in her camp.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068"
    },
    {
        "text": "Er...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...A fire?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I know what you're thinking. But according to what we currently know, it seemed to be an accident.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. Atro left town after that. And we don't know where she went.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#5"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "How can you act like this is all no big deal?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss Folinic! C-calm down!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "text": "We... We'll investigate ourselves. But you tell us she just disappeared after a fire like that's not going to upset us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066#2",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'm very sorry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I'm not going to talk lightly, all I can give you is 'I'm very sorry.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. Atro is a good egg. She's got no Leithanian blood. No connection to us at all, really. And yet she's nobler than anybody around here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "And when the Catastrophe struck Wolumonde, she didn't run away. She offered us help.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have the utmost respect for the good doctor. I hope nothing happened to her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "But after the fire, you saw it yourself, some of the Infected folks don't have the same ideas.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not that I blame them. The town's cut off from the outside world. We're short on supplies. And a gang of armed Infected are out there circling.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066#2",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Armed Infected?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Outlanders. All of them Infected, all of them armed. Most are Leithanian, but there are a few devils among them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The term is 'Sarkaz,' please. I hope the meaning of the word is not lost on you. Do you have any other information about the armed Infected?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "They're merely vultures waiting to pick our bones. And they're not the first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh? So why didn't they immediately show up to plunder the town? Why are they just 'loitering' out there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Just come out with it already.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Wolumonde's lack of sensitivity toward the Infected is understandable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "After all, it's a miracle Leithanien was letting infected people live alongside non-infected people for so long\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014But it's also an opportunity for bad actors to take advantage of such leniency.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you mean?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I told you, Rhodes Island isn't just a bunch of doctors. We're also experts at dealing with the Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are some areas... where I'd rather trust our own judgment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "For example... have you ever heard of the 'Reunion Movement?'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Before the Great Rift, I saw that name in the newspapers from time to time. Mostly reports from Ursus, but occasionally in Leithanien.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "But to a small tourist town, it doesn't mean much. Folks around here would rather listen to the gossip from the next town over than official reports on faraway countries.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you getting at? You think Reunion has something to do with this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I don't want to jump to conclusions. Let's leave it there for now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Right... *Cough*. Either way, thanks for the info.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Speaking from experience, I don't think your side of the story will have much influence on our mission.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's too bad. But honestly, I didn't expect much.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We may have to do some investigating around town. We need to find out what the deal with this 'disappearance' is...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island will demand the necessary compensation from the relevant people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068"
    },
    {
        "text": "Er...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Understood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've no reason to argue with that face of yours.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can move about the town freely, as Dr. Atro's associates. You are honored guests of Wolumonde.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah! But of course! Please, make yourselves at home here. Upstairs is the Wolumonde government's finest parlor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "text": "You must be tired from your long journey? Please, take a rest upstairs while we\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No need. I have something to attend to.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can we start our investigation now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll prepare the paperwork and notify the residents after the meeting. As you wish.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Suzuran, let's go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh? Er, okay! See you soon, Wolumonders!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...*Sigh*.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness01_intro",
        "key": "$darkness01_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "How long can you keep them in the dark?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you see her expression?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I did.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You did. Rhodes Island may not be the type of company to try to extort us, but who knows what they might do to avenge a lost colleague?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "The way I see it, it all ends the same.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But... but, it wasn't our fault. Shouldn't they be after the damned Infected that caused the fire?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We have no proof.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But we can't just take the blame either!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "text": "We tolerated the Infected as much as we could, and how did they repay us? Ever since the Gendarmerie left, they've completely been running rampant!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Indeed. As for the truth, truth is a fickle thing. See this match? Matches are more reliable than the truth.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The doctor's right. You really should quit. You've got a long life ahead of you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "They're 'operators.' I only listen to 'doctors.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Touch\u00e9...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tatjana, keep an eye on our guests. Make sure they don't get into trouble.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, yes, sir! Of course!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Her?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That one, what was the name... Folinic. Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you know what Folinic's expression of pain and anger reminded me of?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't keep me waiting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Councilor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tatjana. It made me think of her. Why didn't she show me a face like that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thor was very nearly her husband. You'd think she'd be a little sad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
